he RELATED: bead-note convention become first-class edges behind [/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]         [#D7D7AF][/dim]the `artifact_links` beta flag.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim] Counts: [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]8[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] phases[dim][/dim] · [bold #D7AFFF][/dim]4[dim][/bold #D7AFFF] waves[/dim]\n[dim]   Path: [#87AFFF][/dim]plan:202608/[bold #87AFFF][/#87AFFF]artifact_link_graph.md[/bold #87AFFF]\n[dim]  1 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Tracked sidecar home for link truth[/bold #D7AFFF]                           [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]home[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]home: stop writing the Referenced By index under .sase/, put it in a [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]tracked links/ tree, and start committing it.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  2 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Link graph types and managed tables in sase-core[/bold #D7AFFF]              [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]core[dim] · [dim][/dim]no dependencies[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]core: add the link-row wire types, relation registry, ManagedTableBlock [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]primitive, Links table, companion paths, and bead link events.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  3 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Python store, flag, and aggregate index[/bold #D7AFFF]                       [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]store[dim] · [dim][/dim]after home, core[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]store: create the artifact_links beta flag, the per-artifact truth [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]adapter, the rebuildable aggregate index, and the v1-to-v2 migration.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  4 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]sase artifact link and sase artifact read[/bold #D7AFFF]                     [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]cli[dim] · [dim][/dim]after store[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]cli: ship sase artifact link add/list/rm and sase artifact read with [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]doctor checks and retention protection.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  5 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Rendered link tables, prompt-ref cites, and companions[/bold #D7AFFF]        [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]render[dim] · [dim][/dim]after store[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]render: project the Links and Referenced By tables, write prompt-ref [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]cites, create companion markdown files, and exclude them from inventory.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  6 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Bead link events, pages, and RELATED: migration[/bold #D7AFFF]               [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]beads[dim] · [dim][/dim]after store[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]beads: persist bead links in the event stream, render them on bead [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]pages, and migrate RELATED: notes.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  7 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]ACE relation source for the link graph[/bold #D7AFFF]                        [bold black on #87D7FF] small  [/bold black on #87D7FF]\n    [#AF87FF]ace[dim] · [dim][/dim]after store[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]ace: add a links/linked_by relation source on every Artifacts pane [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]without blocking the event loop.[/#D7D7AF]\n[dim]  8 [bold #AF87FF][/dim]◆ [bold #D7AFFF][/bold #AF87FF]Glossary, docs, skills, and agent adoption[/bold #D7AFFF]                    [bold black on #FFD75F] medium [/bold black on #FFD75F]\n    [#AF87FF]adopt[dim] · [dim][/dim]after cli, render, beads, ace[/#AF87FF][/dim]\n    [#D7D7AF]adopt: add the Artifact and Artifact Markdown File glossary terms, [/#D7D7AF]\n    [#D7D7AF]rewrite the skills and docs, and snapshot the relation registry.[/#D7D7AF]","clan_tribe":"epic","epic_bead_id":"sase-r8","llm_provider":"grok","model":"grok-4.6","patch_name":"gh_sase-org__sase","phase_bead_id":"sase-r8.3"